<title>USA: U.S. Gulf rig count unchanged at 164 in week.</title>
<headline>U.S. Gulf rig count unchanged at 164 in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>There were 164 rigs under contract in the U.S. Gulf as of September 13, unchanged from the prior week, Offshore Data Services said.</p>
<p>The utilization rate for rigs working in the Gulf, based on a total fleet of 181, was 90.6 percent.</p>
<p>The number of working rigs in European/Mediterranean remained unchanged this week, with 103 rigs under contract out of a total fleet of 103, a utilization rate of 100 percent.</p>
<p>The worldwide rig count rose by five to 559 out of a total fleet of 606, making the utilization rate 92.2 percent.</p>
<p>--New York Energy Desk 212-859-1620</p>
</text>
